      "message": "test(wire): pin the arc door refusal order for a selected Agie chain\n\nThe arc door of #3937 runs before the native door for a selected chain\nthat is not an exact polygon. A lower half circle that encloses the start\nhole now refuses as \"lies inside the profile\". With the hole outside it,\nthe sharp inside corner at X14 Y-14 refuses. The upper half circle still\npins the native \"convex loop\" refusal. Record the order in the decision.\n\nRefs #3937\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
